ww.bseindia.com/xml-data/corpfiling/AttachLive/f440da87-f85e-4536-83b4-45da08d7cfc0.pdf"}],"themes":{"order_wins":["**Vascon Engineers** -- Rs 195.00 cr Letter of Intent from Kanakia Transparent Developers for Shell & Core works on the Mohan Society redevelopment, Borivali (~28.3% of mcap).","**Sathlokhar Synergys E&C Global** -- Rs 157.68 cr order from ReNew Photovoltaics for Main Plant Building civil works at a solar project in Rambilli, AP (~17.7% of mcap), due Feb-2028.","**ACS Technologies** -- Rs 78.15 cr cyber-security and network-management O&M order from an undisclosed domestic customer (~18.8% of mcap).","**ACS Technologies** -- separately wins a Rs 4.26 cr order from P2P Networks for Hyderabad MAN Phase-2 execution services (~1.0% of mcap).","**Affordable Robotic & Automation** -- two purchase orders for robotic welding lines from domestic customers, Rs 39.86 cr and Rs 7.83 cr (~19.6% of mcap combined, our arithmetic).","**Maruti Global Industries** -- Rs 12.16 cr sub-contract order from Naandi Infratech for civil works at the Mayfair Sunrise project, Hyderabad (~62.7% of mcap).","**TechEra Engineering** -- six purchase orders worth Rs 8.63 cr incl. GST (Rs 7.31 cr basic) from a South India-based private space-launch-vehicle company for ground support equipment, deliveries by Feb-2027 (~5.4% of mcap).","**Shayona Engineering** -- Rs 2.86 cr purchase order from an undisclosed domestic customer for engineering components, a day after its Rs 1.87 cr order (~3.9% of mcap).","**Dhara Rail Projects** -- Rs 2.46 cr two-year AMC work order from Daulatram Engineering Services for RMPU maintenance on Mumbai Division AC coaches (~1.3% of mcap).","**G V Electricals** -- Rs 4.17 cr, one-year Rate Contract from TP Northern Odisha Distribution for meter-installation work at Keonjhar (~3.9% of mcap), extendable a second year.","**Indobell Insulations** -- USD 194,736 export order from Nisource Generation (USA) for Steam Turbine Insulation-Blanket Therm, delivery by Oct-2027.","**Innomet Advanced Materials** -- USD 118,275 export purchase order from Israel's Scope Metals Group for Tungsten Class-2 sintered cubes; rupee value not disclosed.","**Sharika Enterprises** -- new work order from PEDA for 2,121 solar LED street-lighting systems in Punjab, a repeat engagement after its earlier 6,447-unit order; value not disclosed."],"equity_allotments":["**Religare Enterprises** -- converts the remaining 75% of 1.45 cr warrants (issued Sep-2025) into equity for the Dhawan family and group entities, Rs 255.99 cr (~3.2% of mcap) _(warrant conversion, past-issued)_ _(★ allotted to Ashish Dhawan)_.","**Finkurve Financial Services** -- converts 51.28 lakh warrants (allotted May-2025) into equity for promoter PRK Trust, Rs 39.9992 cr balance consideration (~4.6% of mcap) _(warrant conversion, past-issued)_."],"m_and_a":["**Clean Max Enviro Energy** -- sells 26% of new SPV Clean Max Gangotri to Gujarat Alkalies and Chemicals for a nominal Rs 26,000 and commits up to Rs 214.49 cr of forward equity into the JV in tranches; SPA still to follow by 31-Jan-2027 _(forward commitment, not yet executed)_.","**Shadowfax Technologies** -- acquires WeFast (Borzo India) for Rs 23.3 cr, entering on-demand intra-city goods transportation.","**Vishnu Chemicals** -- incorporates its 50:50 chrome-metal JV with France's DCX Chrome SAS, announced 7-Sep, as DCX Vishnu Private Limited.","**Enser Communications** -- completes the divestment of Growintelli Technologies to the erstwhile promoters Kunal and Shipra Soni; consideration not disclosed.","**Warren Tea** -- its amalgamation into Maple Hotels & Resorts (NCLT-sanctioned 5-Nov) takes effect from 23-Nov; record date 4-Dec for a 1:1 share swap into Maple, which will list on BSE.","**GOCL Corporation** -- shareholders approve, at an NCLT-convened meeting, the Scheme of Merger by Absorption of Hinduja National Power Corporation into GOCL.","**Waaree Renewable Technologies** -- subsidiary Sunsational Solar novates a solar-project development right to an unrelated power producer, receiving ~Rs 79 cr cost reimbursement (~1.1% of mcap).","**Lumino Industries** -- dissolves its 'LIL-ASPL' joint venture with Aqua-Tech Solution, effective today."],"capex_core":["**Dev Accelerator** -- adds 1,25,551 sq ft of co-working capacity in Bengaluru, Rs 31.65 cr (~7.6% of mcap), by Feb-2027.","**Sathlokhar Synergys E&C Global** -- takes a 99-year SIPCOT lease on 10.09 acres at Thoothukudi for a 1,200 MT capacity addition, due by Mar-2028; lease fee not stated.","**Polyplex Corporation** -- Thailand subsidiary PTL installs a new BOPET film + metalliser line (THB 2,655 mn, ~USD 78.4 mn), 20-24 months, after mothballing its older CPP line (0.86% of group turnover) to free the site."],"business_updates":["**Results season** — 28 companies filed results / earnings-call material today (press releases, recordings, transcripts, presentations) — tracked in the Results tab, not itemised here.","**Brigade Enterprises** -- records Rs 1,600 cr in sales over the launch weekend of Floris at Brigade Autograph, its 40-acre Bengaluru township.","**Alembic Pharmaceuticals** -- receives USFDA final approval for Bosutinib Tablets, 400 mg, a generic for Bosulif (reference drug's own US market estimated at USD 246 mn, IQVIA).","**ROX Hi-Tech** -- publishes the transcript of its 20-Nov H1 FY27 earnings call; figures are in the Results tab."],"distress_risk":["**Hero MotoCorp** -- the Rajasthan High Court quashes RTO demand orders aggregating ~Rs 165 cr for Temporary Registration Certificate fees.","**Rashi Peripherals** -- Customs confirms a Rs 34.62 cr duty, interest and penalty demand; the company is appealing."],"other_notable":["**B-Right Realestate** -- receives a Letter of Intent for the Grandeur redevelopment project in Mulund, Mumbai; projected GDV ~Rs 2,132.6 cr (the company's own estimate, not a contract value)."]},"theme_titles":{"order_wins":"Order wins (notable vs mcap)","fund_raises_fresh_equity":"Fund rais